## Summary

Allow practitioner to configure their own session duration in minutes and also interval between session in minutes in each practice information.

This PR depends on [this PR](https://github.com/konsulin-care/konsulin-api/pull/236) to work properly.

## Purpose

This PR attempts to solve [this issue](https://github.com/konsulin-care/konsulin-app/issues/291).

## Adjustments

Below are several adjustments made to implement this feature:
1. adding two new fields to each practitioner role details: Session Duration and Buffer Time
2. Each new fields are optional

