## Before/After Comparison

| Aspect | Before (CSS Animation) | After (View Transition API) |
|--------|----------------------|----------------------------|
| **Animation Trigger** | Applied on element render via `animation` property | Wrapped dialog operations in `startViewTransition()` |
| **Opening Animation** | `animation: dialog-slide-in 0.3s ease` on `.dialog` | `::view-transition-new(filter-sidebar)` with `dialog-slide-in` keyframe |
| **Closing Animation** | ❌ None (dialog just disappears) | ✅ `::view-transition-old(filter-sidebar)` with `dialog-slide-out` keyframe |
| **Backdrop Animation** | `animation: backdrop-fade-in 0.3s ease` on `.dialog::backdrop` | `::view-transition-new(filter-sidebar-backdrop)` with `backdrop-fade-in` (linear timing) |
| **Backdrop Close** | ❌ None (backdrop just disappears) | ✅ `::view-transition-old(filter-sidebar-backdrop)` with `backdrop-fade-out` (linear timing) |
| **Browser Support** | All browsers | Modern browsers with View Transition API support (graceful fallback) |
| **Code Changes** | Animation defined in CSS only | Utility function `startViewTransition()` used in JS + CSS view-transition names |
| **Benefits** | Simple, works everywhere | ✅ Smoother transitions, proper closing animations, modern API |

## Technical Details

### FilterSidebar.tsx Changes
```typescript
// Added import
import { startViewTransition } from "@/utils/viewTransition"

// Wrapped dialog operations in view transitions
if (isOpen && !dialog.open) {
  startViewTransition(() => {
    dialog.showModal()
  })
} else if (!isOpen && dialog.open) {
  startViewTransition(() => {
    dialog.close()
  })
}
```

### FilterSidebar.module.css Changes
```css
/* Changed from animation to view-transition-name */
.dialog {
  view-transition-name: filter-sidebar;  /* was: animation: dialog-slide-in 0.3s ease; */
}

.dialog::backdrop {
  view-transition-name: filter-sidebar-backdrop;  /* was: animation: backdrop-fade-in 0.3s ease; */
}

/* Added view transition pseudo-elements */
::view-transition-new(filter-sidebar) {
  animation-name: dialog-slide-in;  /* for opening */
}

::view-transition-old(filter-sidebar) {
  animation-name: dialog-slide-out;  /* for closing - NEW! */
}

/* Backdrop animations use linear timing for smooth transitions */
::view-transition-old(filter-sidebar-backdrop),
::view-transition-new(filter-sidebar-backdrop) {
  animation-duration: 0.3s;
  animation-timing-function: linear;  /* Changed from 'ease' to eliminate clunky frames */
}

/* Added closing keyframe */
@keyframes dialog-slide-out {
  from { opacity: 1; transform: translateX(0); }
  to { opacity: 0; transform: translateX(-100%); }
}
```

## Browser Compatibility
The `startViewTransition` utility includes a fallback for browsers that don't support the View Transition API:
```typescript
export function startViewTransition(callback: () => Promise<void> | void) {
  if (document.startViewTransition) {
    document.startViewTransition(callback)
  } else {
    callback()  // Fallback: just execute without transition
  }
}
```

