Exposes ACF user profile fields via WordPress REST API for the `/users` and post endpoints.

## Changes

- **ACF field group**: Added "Author Profile Details" with 12 user meta fields (profile image, social URLs, CTA fields)
- **User endpoint**: Registered fields on `/wp-json/wp/v2/users` with GET/UPDATE support
- **Post endpoints**: Added `author_meta` field to `article` and `project` types, embedding author profile data in post responses

## Implementation

```php
// Helper returns field definitions (DRY)
function portfolio_get_author_profile_fields() { ... }

// Registers fields on /users endpoint
function portfolio_register_user_rest_fields() {
    foreach ( portfolio_get_author_profile_fields() as $field_name => $type ) {
        register_rest_field('user', $field_name, [
            'get_callback' => fn($user) => get_field($field_name, 'user_' . $user['id']),
            'update_callback' => fn($val, $user) => update_field($field_name, $val, 'user_' . $user['id']),
        ]);
    }
}

// Adds author_meta object to posts
function portfolio_register_author_rest_fields() {
    register_rest_field(['article', 'project'], 'author_meta', [
        'get_callback' => fn($post) => array_map(
            fn($field) => get_field($field, 'user_' . $post['author']),
            array_keys(portfolio_get_author_profile_fields())
        ),
    ]);
}
```

## API Response Example

```json
// GET /wp-json/wp/v2/article/123
{
  "id": 123,
  "title": {"rendered": "Tutorial Title"},
  "author": 1,
  "author_meta": {
    "author_profile_image": "https://...",
    "linkedin_url": "https://linkedin.com/in/...",
    "twitter_url": "https://twitter.com/...",
    "author_cta_hook": "Connect with me",
    ...
  }
}
```

Eliminates need for separate user API calls when fetching post data.

